    {
      "id": "text-90",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 980,
      "width": 1778.7,
      "height": 122.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 712710,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 9425610,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Reference: briareus-windows. Other clients match this structure, differing only as noted here.\nOpened from ⚡ Webhook in a conversation's header (\"⚡ Webhook ●\" while it is armed). Needs an Admin token on a server that has session_webhook.\nThe subtitle state is one of on, off, paused, reading… or could not be read. Save (Ctrl+S) is prominent and becomes enabled once something changes or while it is paused. Rotate key appears only while it is armed, and confirms with\n\"Rotate the webhook keys?\" (Rotate).\nEach URL and Key row carries its own help line (for example \"Where a sender posts. The /webhooks/ paths must bypass Cloudflare Access.\").\nWhen paused, a notice reads \"Paused. <reason> Saving this form lifts the pause.\" A notice also shows when the session cannot take deliveries. Leaving with unsaved edits asks \"Discard unsaved changes?\".\nRegion names (sidebar, canvas, raise, sunken) are the theme.* roles; widths and margins are layout.* in tokens/. Greys only, on purpose.",
      "originalText": "Reference: briareus-windows. Other clients match this structure, differing only as noted here.\nOpened from ⚡ Webhook in a conversation's header (\"⚡ Webhook ●\" while it is armed). Needs an Admin token on a server that has session_webhook.\nThe subtitle state is one of on, off, paused, reading… or could not be read. Save (Ctrl+S) is prominent and becomes enabled once something changes or while it is paused. Rotate key appears only while it is armed, and confirms with\n\"Rotate the webhook keys?\" (Rotate).\nEach URL and Key row carries its own help line (for example \"Where a sender posts. The /webhooks/ paths must bypass Cloudflare Access.\").\nWhen paused, a notice reads \"Paused. <reason> Saving this form lifts the pause.\" A notice also shows when the session cannot take deliveries. Leaving with unsaved edits asks \"Discard unsaved changes?\".\nRegion names (sidebar, canvas, raise, sunken) are the theme.* roles; widths and margins are layout.* in tokens/. Greys only, on purpose.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    }
  ],
